  {
    "id": "pathological.unclosed_array_nesting",
    "note": "FX1/DH-1: a model stuck in a repetition loop emits nothing but openers. json.loads recurses once per level and raises RecursionError (not JSONDecodeError) — the crash that used to escape parse_tool_call and kill the whole turn",
    "raw": "[",
    "repeat": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": "pathological.unclosed_object_nesting",
    "note": "FX1/DH-1: the brace flavour of the same loop. Fails shallower inside json.loads (a { must be followed by a key) but the scanners must still bound it",
    "raw": "{",
    "repeat": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": "pathological.unclosed_mixed_nesting",
    "note": "FX1/DH-1: alternating openers — nests as deep as the bracket flavour while looking object-shaped to a find('{') anchor",
    "raw": "[{",
    "repeat": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": "pathological.contract_then_deep_nesting",
    "note": "FX1/DH-1: the reported shape — a real tool-call envelope whose argument value runs away into ~3000 unclosed brackets, so the object anchor finds a legitimate '{' and the repair step is the thing that blows up",
    "prefix": "{\"tool\": \"web_search\", \"args\": {\"queries\": ",
    "raw": "[",
    "repeat": 2999
  },
